       REFRESH-COLOUR-0067.
               INSPECT WS-KEY-CHAR REPLACING ALL SPACES BY '0'.
               IF WS-STATUS-FAILED
                  PERFORM WRITE-ERROR-MESSAGE
               END-IF.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       RECONCILE-BEDROOMS-0068.
               INSPECT WS-KEY-CHAR REPLACING ALL SPACES BY '0'.
               IF WS-STATUS-FAILED
